    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a paper for my sociology class about how national identity is changing. i need to write a section on how countries can maintain their unique cultural heritage and traditions in a world where there's so much global migration and movement of people. can u give me some ideas on what strategies a country might use to protect its core identity from being diluted by mass immigration?",
