      "content": "Nations can strengthen their core identity through the promotion and mandatory inclusion of national language and history in the education system for all residents. Furthermore, supporting and funding traditional cultural practices, like national arts, religious, and local community festivals, can keep these deep-rooted elements visible and vital. Strong cultural policy, which emphasizes the value of the nation's specific historical narrative, can also help solidify a sense of shared belonging.",
